> Say I want to allow `github.com` but block everything else, how can this be achieved?

If I understand the rules engine correctly, this should be:

```json
{
  "permissions": {
    "webfetch": {
      "*": "deny",
      "github.com": "allow"
    }
  }
}
```

I've added [tests here.](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/8855/changes/a497ef5de02641ba6ecd06980144482c699b8dcc) I hope I've understood everything.

@alemairebe thanks but I think I don't think that addresses the issue here. Specifically, missing `cachePoint` on messages leading to always 0 cache reads.

I may be missing something?

